Vendored subset of the ReadTheOrg HTML export theme.

Upstream: https://github.com/fniessen/org-html-themes
Commit:   8a87654701ab24d1bab984524a011bc57f94803b

These files are GPL-3.0, which is NOT the licence of this repository (MIT, see
LICENSE at the root).  They are documentation assets: CSS and JavaScript served
alongside the exported HTML, never compiled into the binary and never linked
against org-semantic's own code.  Keep them under their own licence, and keep
this notice with them.

The bundled jQuery, Bootstrap and stickytableheaders under src/vendor/ carry
their own (MIT) licences from their respective projects.

Verbatim upstream copies; to update, re-copy the same paths from a newer
checkout and bump the commit above.  The Google Fonts and Font Awesome CDN
imports in readtheorg.css are intentionally left remote.
